F holds the connection open and waits rather than erroring, so a\n    slow-but-successful response here (many seconds, possibly close to a\n    minute) is the cold-start tax landing.\n  - Call #2: run immediately after #1. If the model is now warm, this\n    should come back in well under a second. A big gap between call #1 and\n    call #2 is the confirmation.","path":"backend/check_hf_embedding.py","size":2508,"test":false},{"binary":false,"blank":1,"code":12,"comment":0,"exports":["url"],"ext":"py","git":{"added":13,"commits":1,"dates":["2026-09-07"],"deleted":0,"first":"2026-09-07","last":"2026-09-07"},"lang":"python","lines":13,"path":"backend/conn_timing.py","size":297,"test":false},{"binary":false,"blank":7,"code":30,"comment":0,"ext":"ps1","git":{"added":38,"commits":2,"dates":["2026-09-06","2026-09-06"],"deleted":1,"first":"2026-09-06","last":"2026-09-06"},"lang":"shell","lines":37,"path":"backend/load_test_env.ps1","size":1441,"test":false},{"binary":false,"blank":2,"code":21,"comment":0,"ext":"toml","git":{"added":41,"commits":4,"dates":["2026-08-05","2026-08-25","2026-08-25","2026-10-20"],"deleted":18,"first":"2026-08-05","last":"2026-10-20"},"lang":"toml","lines":23,"path":"backend/pyproject.toml","size":1190,"test":false},{"binary":false,"blank":0,"code":11,"comment":0,"ext":"ini","git":{"added":11,"commits":1,"dates":["2026-08-05"],"deleted":0,"first":"2026-08-05","last":"2026-08-05"},"lang":"other","lines":11,"path":"backend/pytest.ini","size":455,"test":false},{"binary":false,"blank":0,"code":217,"comment":0,"ext":"txt","git":{"added":230,"commits":12,"dates":["2026-08-05","2026-08-05","2026-08-05","2026-08-05","2026-08-12","2026-08-13","2026-08-13","2026-08-23","2026-08-28","2026-09-04","2026-09-28","2026-10-26"],"deleted":13,"first":"2026-08-05","last":"2026-10-26"},"lang":"text","lines":217,"path":"backend/requirements.txt","size":8390,"test":false}],"schema":1,"shard":"backend"}
